---
description: Diagram creation standards
globs:
  - "docs/**/*.md"
  - "case-studies/**/*.md"
  - "diagrams/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

Prefer Mermaid for text-maintainable diagrams.

Every diagram must:
- have a title
- name all important components
- show direction clearly
- identify failure or trust boundaries when relevant
- be followed by an explanation
- avoid unnecessary decoration
- render successfully in the documentation site
